  "worked_solution": "The set ${R}^{-}$ denotes the set of negative real numbers. It is equivalent to the following interval:\n\n$$\n(-\\infty ,0)\n$$\n\nThe other options are *not* equivalent to ${R}^{-}:$\n\n- The interval $(-\\infty ,\\infty )$ includes the positive real numbers and zero.\n\n- The interval $(-\\infty ,0]$ includes the zero.\n\n- The interval $(0,\\infty )$ does not include the negative real numbers.\n\n- The interval $[0,\\infty )$ does not include the negative real numbers.",
